                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've had around 50+ hours playing The BoX as I was a alpha and beta tester for the game. I can honestly tell you that this challenging, fun, colourful, and charming platformer is one of the best games you can get on steam for 6$ and is an absolute steal at that price. You will find very little platforms with as much content, challenges, and replayability. While you might be thinking to yourself \" but how can a box and some squares be that good\" ? Well, why don't you buy to find out ;)! This platformer will not let you down!",
